&lt;li&gt;A willingness to work with complexity of globally distributed inference infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience training and deploying Computer Vision models to solve 3D perception tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in training/fine-tuning production-quality 3D Multimodal models and respective encoders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial involvement in and contributions to high impact industry AI projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in generative models for domains such as world models, images, videos, 3D, using techniques such as diffusion or autoregressive models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosure for WA Based &amp;amp; Remote Roles:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
